        <mxCell id="codex-persistence-failure" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="持久化失败：persist-before-publish，不发布半提交；profile registry 与独立轨迹 checkpoint 错误隔离并允许重试" vertex="1">
